000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. DB-INTERFACE.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT DB-LOG-FILE ASSIGN TO "DB_ERR.LOG"
000700     ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD DB-LOG-FILE.
001100 01 DB-LOG-RECORD          PIC X(80).
001200 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001300     EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
001400 01 DB-QUERY-PARAMS.
001500    05 SQL-CUST-ID        PIC X(10).
001600    05 SQL-BAL            PIC 9(7)V99.
001700    05 SQL-STATUS-CODE    PIC X(2).
001800 LINKAGE SECTION.
001900 01 LK-SYSTEM-FLAGS.
002000    05 LK-EOF             PIC X(1).
002100    05 LK-DB-STATUS       PIC X(2).
002200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-SYSTEM-FLAGS.
002300 0000-START.
002400     OPEN EXTEND DB-LOG-FILE
002500     PERFORM 1000-CONNECT-DB
002600     IF LK-DB-STATUS = "00"
002700        PERFORM 2000-QUERY-ACCOUNTS
002800        PERFORM 3000-UPDATE-METRICS
002900     ELSE
003000        PERFORM 8000-LOG-ERROR
003100     END-IF
003200     CLOSE DB-LOG-FILE
